Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Group workflows and notebooks by subproject:
 workflows/sample, notebooks/workload/sample

The existing workflows and their entry points move to subproject "sample";
DAG IDs are unchanged (<bundle>-<name>). The notebooks' %run lines use
../../common. AGENTS.md describes the subproject layout (matching folders
under workflows/, notebooks/workload/ and aidlc-docs/knowledge/, unique
workflow names) and per-subproject AI-DLC knowledge; the README follows,
and a test keeps the folders matched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
